    <item>
      <title>Apex Legends: Latest Update 9/28/2026</title>
      <link>https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1172470/view/694273194214819778</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1172470/view/694273194214819778</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 19:17:40 +0000</pubDate>
      <category>Apex Legends</category>
      <description>&lt;p class="bb_paragraph"&gt;&lt;b&gt;REMINDER:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="bb_paragraph"&gt;Last week, in response to player feedback, we brought back the Core Wildcard mode alongside Apex KO. As a reminder, you should expect slightly longer queue times for either mode, with the higher skilled lobbies being most impacted. The highest successful queue times we're seeing is around 2.5-3.5 minutes. Know before you go!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
